ote":"元公三年，楚公子棄疾弒靈王，自立爲平王。八年，宋火。十年，元公毋信，詐殺諸公子，大夫華、向氏作亂。楚平王太子建來奔，見諸華氏相攻亂，建去如鄭。十五年，元公爲魯昭公避季氏居外，爲之求入魯，行道卒，子景公頭曼立。","source_term":"楚平王太子建"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji038-040","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"qlm_m3s_f3b"},"id_aliases":["cbr-p000422"]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-031","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:m022-0021"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu:p022"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-031-wu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-shiji031-032","subject_person_id":"qlm_m3s_f3b_A","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"iob_qd9_w2s","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p022","quote":"八年，吳使公子光伐楚，敗楚師，迎楚故太子建母於居巣以歸。因北伐，敗陳、蔡之師。九年，公子光伐楚，拔居巣、鍾離。初，楚邊邑卑梁氏之處女與吳邊邑之女爭桑，二女家怒相滅，兩國邊邑長聞之，怒而相攻，滅吳之邊邑。吳王怒，故遂伐楚，取兩都而去。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"母","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"只保存本篇明示父母、祖父、兄弟或妃關係；夏史引語保留敘事來源，不補未見姓名、闕代或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m022-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"iob_qd9_w2s","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p022","chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji031-032","subject_person_id":"qlm_m3s_f3b_A","predicate":"mother","object_person_id":"iob_qd9_w2s","status":